WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.320
But to stay this way, every sovereign nation

00:00:02.320 --> 00:00:04.520
must have the right to control their own borders.

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:08.960
You have the right to control your borders, as we do now,

00:00:08.960 --> 00:00:11.120
and to limit the sheer numbers of migrants

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:12.360
entering their countries,

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:16.240
and paid for by the people of that nation that were there

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:18.639
and that built that particular nation at the time.

